  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Health and Protection assistance to Refugees that fled Ukraine, through the deployment of 2 Health and Protection teams</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide protection and health integrated assistance to a number of most vulnerable individuals among the refugee population in Poland, with focus on areas where persons with specific needs pass regularly (border area in which we are currently working) and in urban areas in which refugees are mainly settled for mid-long-term accommodation in Podkarpackie region and in Dolny &#x15a;l&#x105;sk (Lower Silesia) region</narrative>
  </description>
